## Interface: 120100
## Title: SGDD Reserves
## Notes: Shows guild loot reserves in the RCLootCouncil voting frame.
## Author: JWK95
## Version: @project-version@
## Dependencies: RCLootCouncil
## SavedVariables: SGDDReservesDB

# Group nests this under RCLootCouncil in the addon list, the way
# RCLootCouncil - Merit and RCLootCouncil - Extra Utilities appear. The client
# can also deduce a group on its own, but only when one addon's folder name is a
# complete PREFIX of the other's -- "SGDDReserves" is not, so it has to be said
# explicitly. Saying it is why this addon does not need to be renamed
# "RCLootCouncil_SGDDReserves", which would orphan the saved variables (they are
# keyed on the folder name) and leave anyone who installs the zip by hand with
# two copies loaded at once.
#
# Category puts it under the same "Loot" heading RCLootCouncil files itself
# under, instead of the bottom of an alphabetical list of forty addons.
## Group: RCLootCouncil
## Category-enUS: Loot
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1685978
## X-License: MIT
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Note_01

Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\LibDeflate\LibDeflate.lua

# Pure, no WoW API: loaded first and covered by spec/.
Names.lua
Tiers.lua
Schema.lua
Freshness.lua
Whisper.lua

Core.lua
Import.lua

# The only two files that know RCLootCouncil exists.
RC.lua
VotingColumn.lua

Responder.lua
Nag.lua
OfficerFrame.lua
Options.lua
